---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { SITE_DATA } from "../constants";
import portraitImage from "../assets/portrait.webp";

import "../styles/about.css";
---

<Layout pageTitle="About">
  <div class="page-container">
    <h1>About me</h1>

    <div class="about-content">
      <div class="about-intro-wrapper centered-column">
        <div class="about-header centered-column">
          <Image
            src={portraitImage}
            alt={SITE_DATA.name}
            class="about-portrait"
          />
          <h2 class="about-name">{SITE_DATA.name}</h2>
        </div>

        <p class="intro-text">
          I am a driven Software Engineer and Researcher with a strong
          foundation in full-stack development, mobile application architecture,
          and multimodal machine learning. A graduate of the National Institute
          of Technology Karnataka (NITK), Surathkal, I bridge the gap between
          robust software engineering practices and cutting-edge computational
          linguistics. My recent research focuses on Natural Language Processing
          (NLP) and Deep Learning, specifically pioneering multi-modal
          frameworks for low-resource Indian languages. Professionally, I excel
          in building scalable backend engines, optimizing database
          efficiencies, and creating seamless user interfaces across web and
          mobile platforms.
        </p>
      </div>

      <section>
        <h2>Research Statement</h2>
        <div class="info-card">
          <p>"There is more to it that meets the eye."</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Research Specialisations</h2>
        <ul class="custom-list">
          <li>
            <span class="list-item-title">Multimodal Machine Learning</span>
            <span class="list-item-description"
              >Designing and fine-tuning hybrid frameworks that fuse text-based
              encoding (e.g., BERT) with image-based convolutional networks
              (e.g., DenseNet) to interpret complex, culturally nuanced digital
              media.</span
            >
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="list-item-title"
              >Low-Resource Natural Language Processing (NLP)</span
            >
            <span class="list-item-description"
              >Developing novel datasets and baseline classification systems for
              underrepresented regional languages, specifically Telugu and
              Kannada, to automatically detect domain contexts and social media
              trolling.</span
            >
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="list-item-title"
              >Applied Cryptography & Decentralized Systems:</span
            >
            <span class="list-item-description"
              ><em>Felis catus</em>Implementing secure architecture protocols,
              including RSA encryption, blind signatures for identity
              obfuscation, and consensus protocols inspired by blockchain
              technology.</span
            >
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="list-item-title">Algorithmic Optimization</span>
            <span class="list-item-description"
              >Utilizing advanced data structures (such as Tries) to build
              efficient, high-performance rule evaluation and data-filtering
              engines.</span
            >
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Positions</h2>
        <ul class="work-list icon-list">
          <li>
            <div class="list-entry">
              <h3>Software Engineer (Java/Full-Stack)</h3>
              <p class="institution">Coforge Ltd | Jul 2024 – Present</p>
              <p>
                Spearheaded the design and development of an end-to-end
                management framework for a Rule-Based Payment Enrichment System.
                Engineered a high-performance Condition Evaluation Engine
                utilizing Trie data structures and optimized complex database
                operations. Designed and integrated responsive user interfaces
                to manage backend configurations seamlessly.
              </p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div class="list-entry">
              <h3>Flutter / Android Developer Intern</h3>
              <p class="institution">IRIS Labs (NITK) | Apr 2022 – Oct 2022</p>
              <p>
                Developed the "Urja" module for the core IRIS mobile
                application, gaining hands-on experience with IoT device
                interaction and maintainable software design patterns.
              </p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div class="list-entry">
              <h3>React Native / Android Developer Intern</h3>
              <p class="institution">Easy Events | Jun 2022 – Aug 2022</p>
              <p>
                Developed the "Urja" module for the core IRIS mobile
                application, gaining hands-on experience with IoT device
                interaction and maintainable software design patterns.
              </p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div class="list-entry">
              <h3>Co-Author & Researcher</h3>
              <p class="institution">
                Meme Analytics in Low-Resource Languages
              </p>
              <p>
                Collaborated on pioneering multimodal research published in
                Speech and Language Technologies for Low-Resource Languages.
                Contributed to dataset creation, benchmarking, and fine-tuning
                deep learning models for classification tasks in Telugu and
                Kannada digital media.
              </p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Education</h2>
        <ul class="education-list icon-list">
          <li>
            <div class="education-entry">
              <h3>
                Bachelor of Technology (B.Tech.) in Information Technology
              </h3>
              <p class="institution">
                National Institute of Technology Karnataka (NITK), Surathkal
                Graduation Year: 2024
              </p>
              <p class="grade">
                Core Focus: Software Engineering, Algorithms, Database
                Management, and Advanced Application Development.
              </p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>CV</h2>
        <div class="info-card">
          <p>For a full curriculum vitae, see my LinkedIn profile.</p>
          <a
            href={`https://linkedin.com/in/${SITE_DATA.linkedin}`}
            class="info-card-link"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            aria-label="Visit my LinkedIn profile">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="60" height="60" fill="currentColor">
              <path
                d="M20.5 2h-17A1.5 1.5 0 002 3.5v17A1.5 1.5 0 003.5 22h17a1.5 1.5 0 001.5-1.5v-17A1.5 1.5 0 0020.5 2zM8 19H5v-9h3zM6.5 8.25a1.75 1.75 0 110-3.5 1.75 1.75 0 010 3.5zM19 19h-3v-4.74c0-1.42-.6-1.93-1.38-1.93A1.74 1.74 0 0013 14.19V19h-3v-9h2.9v1.3a3.11 3.11 0 012.7-1.4c1.55 0 3.4 1.08 3.4 3.93z"
              ></path>
            </svg>
            <span>LinkedIn</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Collaboration enquiries, methodology debates, and Monoceros Initiative
          questions are welcome via
          <a href={`mailto:${SITE_DATA.email}`}>e-mail</a> or
          <a
            href={`https://linkedin.com/in/${SITE_DATA.linkedin}`}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a
          >. Specific enquiries get specific replies. Generic partnership
          pitches are recycled with great efficiency.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
